# BAML-generated client — regenerate with `baml generate` (run from
# activegraph/, driven by activegraph/baml.toml + baml_src/). Only the
# generated baml_sdk/ subtree is ignored: activegraph/baml_client/__init__.py
# is a real, committed re-export that must survive regeneration (Behavior 1,
# TDD BAML LLMProvider plan) -- a directory-level ignore here would silently
# drop it from git too, not just from regeneration.
activegraph/baml_client/baml_sdk/
